OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mainly dry, bright day with
OL,6,Fplenty of sunny spells. Sunshine will
OL,7,Fturn a little hazy at times through
OL,8,Fthe afternoon. Winds will be light.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FIt will be a dry evening with
OL,11,Fsome bright or sunny spells to end the
OL,12,Fday. Remaining dry overnight with
OL,13,Fvariable cloud and some clear spells.
OL,14,
OL,15,CTuesday:FA dry and bright day with
OL,16,Fvariable cloud and some hazy sunny
OL,17,Fspells. Light winds and becoming very
OL,18,Fwarm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
